  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You revel in battle, and face combat with fearlessness. Whenever you critically hit with a Strike, or a creature critically fails a saving throw from your spell or ability, you reduce any Frightened condition you have by 1. If you aren’t Frightened, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to a single attack roll or Intimidation check of your choice in the next minute, but if you would be Frightened before then you can instead forego this bonus to reduce it by 1.</span></p>"
